    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nImport your flowchart from your **Backpack**, then prompt AI with with your flowchart to implement the rule you chose:\r\n\r\na. The lights turn on only if motion is detected AND it is nighttime.\r\n\r\nb. The lights turn on if motion is detected OR it is nighttime.\r\n",
